    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d193">

                <pb facs="0267" n="1001" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1001"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Butler to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic">July 26,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Extradition Chester denied. Held here for trial. Shall I protest against
                    precedent or ask his extradition as Mexican citizen?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Butler.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
